  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and Evidence for Nepal&apos;s Transition (RENT Bridge)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RENT, a regional project under RED, ended on 31 Mar 2024 which supported BEK senior leadership with researches and evidences for supporting policy and programmeing. Considering the need to continue the partnership with YALE and SOAS. BEK SLT agreed to allocated E4D budget to continue the research activities as per the need of BEK.</narrative>
  </description>
